# Breakdown with a full bar of silence before the re-entry.
@tempo 140
@map RS Monarch
[breakdown] bars=3 feel=f
grid 16
kick  | X..x..X...x..x.. |
snare | ........X....... |
china | X.......X....... |
[pause] bars=1 feel=mf
grid 16
kick  | ................ |
[reentry] bars=2 feel=ff
grid 16
kick  | X.x.x.x.X.x.x.x. |
snare | ....X.......X... |
crash | X............... |
